# Optional, and best left unset. The broker's password normally lives in
# ~/.config/agentbus/redis.env (0600): ./setup.sh install writes it for a fresh broker,
# ./setup.sh rotate-redis-password replaces it, and compose and every agentbus/busmon process
# read it there. A REDIS_PASSWORD set in this checkout's .env (copied from this file; gitignored)
# reaches compose only: the clients then need the same value exported in their shell, and the
# rotation refuses to run while it is set. Without either, the historical AgentBus2025! applies.
# REDIS_PASSWORD=change-me
